# Normalise line endings to LF in the repository AND in the working tree.
#
# This matters for deployment, not aesthetics: run_cycle.sh is scp'd to a Linux
# VPS and executed by cron. A CRLF shebang fails there with "bad interpreter",
# and the failure is silent from the fund's point of view.
* text=auto eol=lf
*.sh text eol=lf
*.py text eol=lf
*.json text eol=lf
*.md text eol=lf

# Binary-ish safety net (nothing currently matches, but keeps future artefacts sane)
*.png binary
*.gz binary
